  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Classes",
    "section": "3.196",
    "heading": "As a Multiclass Character",
    "lineStart": 3585,
    "lineEnd": 3588
  },
  "section": "3.196",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Ranger Traits table: Hit Point Die, proficiency with Martial weapons, proficiency in one skill of your choice from the Ranger's skill list, and training with Light and Medium armor and Shields.  \n- Gain the Ranger's level 1 features, which are listed in the Ranger Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
}
